        "created_at": "2018-01-27T02:44:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I would buy a console version, because I do enjoy couch co-op games in general... but I get what people are saying about spending enoough on the current games to justify buying it another time. That said Steam, Android, Ios, Ps4, Switch (which I don't have yet), Xbox in that order is my priority. After Oblivaeon the things I want most to see available are Story Mode, and Workshop (assuming Cauldron and maybe even Earth Prime are off the table as of now.) Hope that helps. Depending on finances I might even chip in more than I should/need to help make things happen, as I did with season 2, because truly good games from the \"little guy\" companies deserve my support.&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 22,
