        "id": 213738,
        "name": "WarrenAC",
        "username": "WarrenAC",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/d2c977/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-01-29T06:18:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I would definitely buy a Story Mode DLC for Android.&nbsp; I guess there's also tracking the Story Challenges but maybe they were hoping to roll that all into Story Mode.</p><p>Heck,&nbsp; I'd probably pick up Swaptober/Animal-verse/Tactics/RPG (cosmetic) variants if they ever existed...and of course Earth Prime,Cauldron...</p><p><span>Basically,&nbsp; I realised today that I'm probably a year or so behind on my Sentinels budget, if there were more things to pick up there ;)&nbsp; I sadly don't own a console (there's maybe a NES somewhere?) - I'd buy things on Steam if there was Workshop support,&nbsp; but my tablet is probably more powerful...</span></p>",
